{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>For the leader, on the eighth.</b> The eighth — some say: a musical instrument that has eight strings. Or a poem that has eight melodies; therefore it is written בנגינות (with musical instruments), and this is upon the eighth pleasantness."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:27.774733145Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}